# Mirrored to band-studio by .github/workflows/mirror-to-band-studio.yml on every push to main.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you used Band to make figures or quantify bands in your work, please cite it."
type: software
title: "Band: publication-ready western blot and gel figures"
abstract: >-
  Band is a desktop application for arranging, annotating, size-calibrating and
  quantifying western blot and DNA gel images, exporting reproducible
  publication-ready figures.
authors:
  - family-names: Pries
    given-names: Michael
